#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/filesystems/reiser.xml:157
msgid ""
"can sometimes help to solve problems with "
"<application>ReiserFS</application> file systems. If it is called without "
"options, it prints the super block of any "
"<application>ReiserFS</application> file system found on the device"
msgstr ""
"pode, ocasionalmente, ajudar a resolver problemas com sistemas de arquivos "
"<application>ReiserFS</application>. Se for chamado sem opções, [então] "
"imprime o super bloco de qualquer sistema de arquivos "
"<application>ReiserFS</application> encontrado no dispositivo"

